WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.592 --> 00:00:12.039
Sign in as the business owner.

2
00:00:12.139 --> 00:00:18.276
Open People, then Team. Everyone who can sign in to your business is listed here with their role.

3
00:00:20.176 --> 00:00:26.643
Each row shows the member and role. Use Edit to change a person, or Deactivate to stop them signing in.

4
00:00:27.401 --> 00:00:33.591
To add someone, click Invite team member. They get an email with a link to set their own password.

5
00:00:33.691 --> 00:00:38.781
Enter their email address. Use a demo address like this one when you practise.

6
00:00:38.881 --> 00:00:43.367
Choose a role. The role decides which screens and actions they get.

7
00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:47.844
Tick the branches they work at. A cashier at Camp only sees Camp.

8
00:00:47.944 --> 00:00:53.969
Click Send invitation. If the email cannot be sent, you get a link to share with them yourself.

9
00:00:56.270 --> 00:01:01.856
To change a role later, open Team and click Edit on the person.

10
00:01:01.956 --> 00:01:08.092
You can change their name, role and branches here. Email stays fixed because it is their sign-in.

11
00:01:08.193 --> 00:01:11.798
Click Cancel if you do not want to change anything.

12
00:01:11.898 --> 00:01:17.818
Roles & Permissions lists every role, how many permissions it has and how many people use it.

13
00:01:20.122 --> 00:01:25.983
Owner can do everything. The built-in roles are ready to use, and Add role creates your own.

14
00:01:26.084 --> 00:01:30.407
Click Edit on Cashier to see its permissions, grouped by module.

15
00:01:30.507 --> 00:01:37.028
A ticked box means allowed. Cashiers can view products and stock, so they can find items at the counter.

16
00:01:37.128 --> 00:01:41.724
They cannot create, update or delete products: those boxes are empty.

17
00:01:41.824 --> 00:01:47.961
Scroll down to see sales, customers and gift cards. Cashiers can ring up sales and add customers.

18
00:01:48.061 --> 00:01:54.086
Reports, purchasing, settings and team management are not ticked, so a cashier never sees them.

19
00:01:54.186 --> 00:01:59.661
Tick or untick boxes and click Save changes to adjust a role. That is team and roles.
